{"id":"9a2e92340a207163","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","title":"Def Operator","display":"df-def-operator — Def Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-def-operator","aliases":["58-df-def-operator"],"display":"df-def-operator — Def Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-def-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-def-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-def-operator — Def Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Assign}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Assign}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\mathfrak M_M\\in V\">\\(D,M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\mathfrak M_M\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathfrak M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathfrak M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> (binary-relation interpretation component, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M_M)=M\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M_M)=M\\)</span>, and the binary relation symbol of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\in}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\in}\\)</span> is interpreted by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\">\\(\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\)</span> (membership-language formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Assign}\">\\(\\operatorname{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> provide the set-coded satisfaction recursion, assignments, and free-variable operator</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(M)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(M)\\)</span> (power set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}\\)</span> (definability relation and operator introduced here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(D,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nD=\\Bigl\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(M):\n\\exists\\Sigma_{\\in},\\mathfrak M_M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\n\\varphi,n,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M_M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec a,n,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in X\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Assign}(\\mathfrak M_M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=x\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{160pt}\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\vec a(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(D,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nD=\\Bigl\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(M):\n\\exists\\Sigma_{\\in},\\mathfrak M_M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\n\\varphi,n,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M_M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\vec a,n,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in X\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Assign}(\\mathfrak M_M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=x\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{160pt}\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\vec a(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}def\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Def}(M)=D\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(D,M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}def\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Def}(M)=D\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(D,M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}(M)\\)</span> is the family of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> first-order definable over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\">\\(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\)</span> with parameters from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.  The meta-notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_M\\models\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\">\\(\\mathfrak M_M\\models\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\)</span> has been replaced by the registered satisfaction recursion and an explicit assignment of the object and parameter variables.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I^{\\mathfrak M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}$ (binary-relation interpretation component, see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in})$, $\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M_M)=M$, and the binary relation symbol of $\\Sigma_{\\in}$ is interpreted by $\\in\\cap(M\\times M)$ (see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\in})$ (membership-language formulas, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{P}(M)$ (power set, see [[58-df-powerset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Assign}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":